## Architecture summary

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    CLI[main.py - InventoryCLI] --> DB[database.py - InventoryDatabase]
    DB --> Models[models.py - Domain Models]
    DB --> Config[config.py - SQLite Connection]
    Config --> SQLite[(data/inventory.db)]

    subgraph tables [Database Tables]
        Users[users]
        Categories[categories]
        Suppliers[suppliers]
        Products[products]
        Transactions[stock_transactions]
    end

    SQLite --> tables
    Products --> Categories
    Products --> Suppliers
    Transactions --> Products
    Transactions --> Users
